  "prefLabel": "Rev 1901.03 Cash receipts journal",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-03-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1901.03 \"Cash receipts journal\" means a chronological record showing details of the source and amount of each receipt, the names of the payors and the cumulative amount of receipts for each fiscal period.\n\nSource. #5356, eff 3-16-92, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6732, eff 4-18-98; ss by #8599, eff 4-6-06; ss by #10582, eff 5-2-14; ss by #13918, eff 3-29-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1900)",
